## Escalate instead of guessing when

- acceptance, scope, or a material product decision is unclear;
- the baseline is unexpectedly red;
- the work becomes unattended, genuinely independent multi-slice, irreversible, external, or higher risk; or
- repeated verification is not making progress.

Time and cost are planning estimates unless the host can measure and enforce them.

